WEBVTT

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:08.350
This is what your clients see when they
open your booking page.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.350
They can explore your services and
choose the appointment they want.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:20.080
Here, Sarah chooses BIAB Overlay and
adds optional Simple Nail Art.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:21.750
Then she taps Continue.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.210
Next, she chooses an available date and
time.

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:29.150
This studio has one technician.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:37.400
The review screen shows the service,
price, duration, time, and location.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:41.450
She enters her name, email, and mobile
number.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.650
The required fields are clearly marked.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.420
She reads the appointment agreement

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:50.800
and checks the required acknowledgment
before continuing.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:57.400
With the details reviewed, she taps
Confirm appointment.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:02.940
The confirmation screen shows that the
booking is complete.

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:04.450
Her time is reserved.
